  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    text: 'Why are you keeping this piece of paper with you? '
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Piece of paper?! But you\u2019re crazy! It\u2019s one of my greatest treasures!"
  - speaker: 0
    text: How is it a treasure?
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'This object came long before the cataclysm, when men lived in opulence
      and in harmony with the atom. '
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'I sometimes wonder what sin they committed to condemn our world ...

'
